blushrebuff_gentlerebuff_harshproposition&A romantic advance.kiss mei love youmarry me"will you marry me&come to bed with mei want you.spend the night with mebe minelet me kiss you*i want to be with youi desire you&will you be my wife,will you be my husband(i'm in love with you2come home with me tonight$i want to hold youaccept_advancedefer_advanceask_name6Asking who the listener is."what is your namewho are you what's your name*what do they call you&may i ask your nameyour name"tell me your name&what are you called(who am i speaking to0i didn't catch your nameand you are,what should i call you$do you have a nametell_namerefuse_nameask_profession<Asking what the listener does.what do you do$what is your tradewhat's your job6what do you do for a living&what work do you do.what is your profession4how do you earn your bread&what do you do hereare you a guardare you a miner2what's your business here2how do you make your coin"what is it you dotell_workrefuse_curtask_wellbeing6Asking how the listener is.how are you"how are you doinghow do you fareare you wellhow goes ithow are thingshow's your dayare you alright"how have you been8you look tired, are you well.is everything all righthow do you feelwhat's wrongare you okaytell_moodask_aboutlAsking what the listener knows or thinks of something.,tell me about the king@what do you know about the minesJwhat can you tell me about the guards8what do you think of the war4tell me about this villageDdo you know anything about the sea8what do you know of the gods8tell me more about the roads*what about the wolves>what do you make of the weatherDi want to know about the smugglers0tell me about the tavernBwhat is your opinion of the crown2know anything about bears what do you know tell me about it2speak to me of the temple:what do you think about taxes8have you heard of the castletell_topicdont_knowask_whatrefuse_tellask_whereAsking the way.&where is the tavern:where can i find a blacksmith4how do i get to the castle.which way to the market2where is the nearest town.where can i buy a sword4i'm looking for the temple:do you know where the mine iswhere am i<can you point me to the harbor,which road leads north>i am lost, where is the village<where would i find the captain,is there an inn nearby.where does this road go&how far is the citygive_directionsdont_know_whereask_rumor Asking for news.any news heard any rumors8what's happening around here0what's the latest gossip:anything interesting going on.what news from the road.have you heard anything tell me the news,any word from the city(what are folk sayinggot any stories6what's the talk of the town,anything i should know8hear anything strange latelytell_rumorno_rumorask_trade,Asking to buy or sell..i want to buy something2what do you have for sale&do you sell weapons(can i see your wares"i'd like to trade(what are you selling(i have goods to sell"will you buy this,how much for the swordlet's trade*show me what you have$i need to buy food8do you have anything to sell"what does it cost8i'm looking to sell some oredecline_tradeask_work2Asking for a job or task.6do you have any work for me(i'm looking for work.is there a job i can do2need any help around here2any tasks that need doing2i need coin, got any work$can i work for you4do you have a quest for me is anyone hiring@looking for an honest day's work2anything that needs doing got a job for me2who is hiring around hereno_workask_help Asking for help.can you help me i need your helpplease help me.could you do me a favori need a hand will you help mehelp me, please*i could use some help6can you do something for me"i need assistance would you aid me<i have a problem, can you helplend me a handoffer_helpdecline_helpdemand:Demanding something by force.$give me your money&hand over your coinyour purse, now6give me everything you have(hand it over or else$give me your sword,your gold or your life$empty your pockets(i'm taking your coingive me thatpay up&hand over the goods2give me all your gold now@i will take what i want from yourefuse_demandyield_demandbeg(Begging for charity.spare a coin(please, i'm starving.can you spare some foodNi have nothing, please help a poor soul"alms for the poor spare some bread.i haven't eaten in daysZcould you spare a coin for a hungry traveller6please, just a little moneyhave pity on me,anything you can spare0a coin for a poor beggargive_pityrefuse_begjokeTelling a joke.&want to hear a jokeDwhy did the chicken cross the road8i have a funny story for you.here's a riddle for youHdid you hear the one about the minerthat's funnyi'm only jokingjust kidding,let me tell you a joke6a guard walks into a tavern(you'll laugh at thisha ha, good one$i was only jestinglaugh_jokegroan_jokeunamused
