arguesmall_talkIdle talk.$nice weather today(lovely day, isn't itit's cold todaylooks like rain.what a storm last night,the sun is out at last:terrible weather we're havingquiet day todaybusy day(it is a fine morning6the nights are getting cold@winter is coming early this year*this wind never stops small_talk_replybragBoasting.Bi killed a bear with my own handsNi am the greatest swordsman in the land4i have slain a hundred men:no one can beat me in a fight>i once fought ten bandits alonei am very richHi'm the best hunter you'll ever meet@i have travelled the whole world<i saved a village from raiders6i'm stronger than any guard0they sing songs about me2i have never lost a fightimpressedunimpressedask_familyFAsking after the listener's family.(do you have a familyare you married(do you have children2tell me about your family$do you have a wife*do you have a husbandany kids(where is your family>do you have brothers or sisters(is your mother alive"do you live alone who are your kintell_familyask_opinion^Asking what the listener thinks of the speaker..what do you think of medo you like meare we friendsdo you trust me what am i to you0how do you feel about me am i your frienddo you hate me2what's your opinion of me&have i offended you(are we on good termstell_regardask_followDAsking the listener to come along.come with mefollow mejoin metravel with me&will you come along4i need you to come with me"let's go togetherwalk with mecome along4you should join my journeyride with merefuse_followbeast_obeydismiss@Telling the listener to go away.go awayleave me aloneget lostbe gone&get out of my sight$stop talking to meshut up.i'm done talking to you
